+```text
+deg D=6,  Q=[1:0:0],  (v,u)=(Y/X,Z/X),
+Delta=(6,4,3),  (mult_Q,I_Q(D,L_infty))=(2,6),
+beta_1=15,  delta_infty=7,  delta_aff=3,
+```
