+```
+
+have degrees `6,9` but `4a^3+27b^2=-81h^2-108`, a reduced degree-six
+polynomial.  It is reducible, so it is not a row example; it shows that a
+separate argument using irreducibility/normality is indispensable.
+
+Accordingly the unconditional route stops at the four-coefficient identity
+(2.2).  The two precise missing statements are
+`OPEN[TRIPLE-COVER-GLOBAL-MONOGENIZATION]` and
+`OPEN[TRIPLE-COVER-DEGREE-CONTROL]`.  Sections 3--6 solve the charged
+one-variable system **conditionally** on both statements.
